List the physical block numbers holding the data of one regular file inside an ext2/3/4 or f2fs image (holes are skipped; erofs is refused)

Usage: android-doctor blocks [OPTIONS] <IMAGE> <PATH>

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>  
  <PATH>   

Options:
      --json      Print JSON instead of text
      --no-color  Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
